menu "AllSky Display"

    choice ALLSKY_PANEL
        prompt "Round DSI panel variant (first-boot default only)"
        default ALLSKY_PANEL_3_4
        help
            FIRST-BOOT DEFAULT ONLY. Both round panels are supported at runtime from a single
            binary; the active panel is selected from persisted configuration (NVS key disp_type,
            changeable in the web UI, restart required to apply). This choice only sets the value
            of disp_type on a fresh device with no stored configuration. It does NOT compile out
            either panel: the BSP and the app display profile pick the panel at runtime.

        config ALLSKY_PANEL_3_4
            bool "3.4 inch round, 800x800 (type id 1, default)"
            help
                First-boot disp_type = 1. Waveshare 3.4-inch round DSI panel, JD9365 reg 0x40 = 0x00.

        config ALLSKY_PANEL_4_0
            bool "4.0 inch round, 720x720 (type id 2)"
            help
                First-boot disp_type = 2. Waveshare 4.0-inch round DSI panel
                (ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-4C), JD9365 reg 0x40 = 0x04.
    endchoice

endmenu
